  "rlbDailyWeeklyHint": "Each week the top 10 by total Daily Challenge score for the whole week get 💎 (locked at the start of next week, UTC).",
  "howToTooltip": "How to play",
  "howToRecipesTitle": "How to play: Recipes",
  "howToRecipes1": "Learn recipes with SPACED REVIEW: each day the game picks the drinks that are due and you answer a few questions.",
  "howToRecipes2": "Each drink has 4 levels: New → Familiar → Learned → Mastered. A correct answer levels it up and schedules the next review in {a} / {b} / {c} days; a wrong one drops it one level and brings it back right away.",
  "@howToRecipes2": {"placeholders": {"a": {"type": "int"}, "b": {"type": "int"}, "c": {"type": "int"}}},
  "howToRecipes3": "Questions get harder with the level: New fills in the missing ingredient, Familiar guesses the amount, Learned/Mastered picks the correct full recipe.",
  "howToRecipes4": "Reviewing a drink that isn't due is practice only: no level change and no reward. You can watch an ad for a hint (that question doesn't count).",
  "howToRecipes5": "Reaching each level for the first time earns coins; the first Mastered also earns 💎. Milestones of Mastered drinks (5, 10, 20…) give accessory chests.",
  "howToRecipes6": "Review every day to keep your 🔥 streak and earn 💎 at 3 / 7 / 14 / 30 days; a broken streak can be rescued with 💎. Learn {n} drinks of a group to unlock the next group.",
  "@howToRecipes6": {"placeholders": {"n": {"type": "int"}}},
  "howToOrdersTitle": "How to play: Brew by order",
  "howToOrders1": "A customer orders a drink: drag (or tap) ingredients from the tray into the cup, then set the amount.",
  "howToOrders2": "In the amount sheet, tap the ruler or HOLD the pour button to raise the amount; lower levels show guide marks.",
  "howToOrders3": "Tap Serve: the cup is sealed and shaken, then each ingredient is graded — exact, one step off, wrong amount, missing or extra.",
  "howToOrders4": "The better you know a drink, the fewer hints: New shows the sample recipe and a green mark, Familiar only the ingredient names, Learned only how many, Mastered nothing. New/Familiar allow one step off; Learned/Mastered must be exact.",
  "howToOrders5": "The result counts toward the drink's level like a quiz answer. Watch an ad to reveal the sample recipe (that order doesn't count).",
